@amanpour What drivel. "Artists don't want to get a permit". 

You are seeking to transit a sovereign nation. You need paperwork to do so. I don't care if you don't feel like it. 

If it's difficult, it's because you support people who kill innocent people.

@amanpour The tragedies experienced by the Palestinian people since 1948 continue to this day, in an even more violent and harsh manner. Killing, displacement, forced relocation, land theft, apartheid...
